  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "It appears that the import/export test infrastructure conflicts with the default Fedora ports (8080, 61616).",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "To see the error, start Fedora in Tomcat (as with the one-click Jetty-run). ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Then build the import/export tool (mvn clean install)... see test failures.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "One difference with the import/export tooling from other Fedora projects is that it uses \"cargo\". The core Fedora project has test configuration that selects random ports instead of the defaults. I would be happy to discuss the example of Fedora's configuration if that would be helpful.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
